    "description": "<p>This is the reader-facing SGA working record for the Modern LaTeX Editions of Mathematics Manuscripts project. This version adds a 309-page cumulative English SGA 5 working translation synchronized against the current French workpass, with direct scan adjudication at source-critical formula, index, arrow, diagram, statement, footnote, and omission loci.</p><p><strong>Open first:</strong> <code>00_SGA5_English_SourceChecked_WorkingTranslation_NotCritical_20260717.pdf</code>. The following two reader PDFs provide the current SGA 5 French workpass and the SGA 6 French source-rescribe checkpoint. Editable English TeX, the complete LNM 589 source scan, French and inherited-English controls, correction and structural ledgers, build logs, and complete rendered QA are grouped in <code>03_SGA5_English_TeX_Audit_and_SourceSupport_NotCritical_20260717.zip</code>.</p><p><strong>SGA 5 English status:</strong> the cumulative covers the ten exposes represented in the current volume-level workpass (I, III, III B, V, VI, VII, VIII, X, XII, and XV) and the index through printed page 484. The final-resolution ledger closes 432 scan-derived candidates; additional residual and adversarial passes restore omitted sections and repair further prose, formula, and diagram-topology defects. The 309-page PDF renders completely. One source glyph ambiguity is retained explicitly rather than guessed.</p><p><strong>SGA 6 status:</strong> the French source-rescribe frontier remains ledger entry #679 / scan idx662 / volume p649 / Expose XIII p34, with idx663 next. The separate English SGA 6 synchronization lane is active, but no newer whole-lane English claim is made here: its TeX, PDF, ledgers, and status must agree on one frozen endpoint before promotion.</p><p><strong>Scope:</strong> these are substantive machine-assisted, source-aware working translations and repair materials, not OCR-only output. They are not independently human-certified critical editions, whole-SGA completion claims, or guarantees that every remaining source ambiguity has been resolved. Corrections can be proposed through the GitHub mirror: <a href=\"https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts\">https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts</a>.</p>",
    "additional_descriptions": [
      {
        "description": "Reader-first SGA surface with frozen SGA6 source-rescribe checkpoint through ledger entry #679 / idx662 and the retained source-checked English Expose X restart through printed p524. Not a completed or critical edition, global source-faithfulness certification, synchronized English edition, or diagram-by-diagram certification.",
        "type": {
          "id": "notes",
          "title": {
            "de": "Anmerkungen",
            "en": "Notes"
          }
        }
      }
    ]
